<h2>1. Introduction</h2>
<p>DataDecision.consulting ("we", "our", or "us") is committed to protecting your privacy. This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, and safeguard your information when you visit our website.</p>

<h2>2. Information We Collect</h2>
<p>Even if you do not create an account, we may collect non-personal information automatically when you visit our site. This includes IP addresses, browser types, operating systems, and analytics data regarding your interaction with our website (such as pages viewed and time spent).</p>
<p>If you contact us via email (e.g., at contact@datadecision.consulting), we will collect your email address and any information you provide in your message.</p>

<h2>3. How We Use Your Information</h2>
<p>We use the collected information to:</p>
<ul>
    <li>Improve, maintain, and secure our website.</li>
    <li>Analyze user trends to enhance our content and services.</li>
    <li>Respond to your direct inquiries or requests for a brief.</li>
</ul>

<h2>4. Cookies and Tracking Technologies</h2>
<p>We may use cookies or similar tracking technologies to improve user experience. You can instruct your browser to refuse all cookies or to indicate when a cookie is being sent.</p>

<h2>5. Third-Party Services</h2>
<p>We do not sell, trade, or rent your personal identification information to others. We may share generic aggregated demographic information not linked to any personal identification information with our business partners and trusted affiliates for the purposes outlined above.</p>

<h2>6. Contact Us</h2>
<p>If you have any questions about this Privacy Policy, please contact us at: <strong>contact@datadecision.consulting</strong>.</p>

